    "Connect and sign in to Codex in Agents & Chat. Your selected model is retained.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Connect and sign in to Codex in Agents & Chat. Your selected model is retained."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "请在“智能体与聊天”中连接并登录 Codex。已选模型会保留。"}}}},
    "Open a Triptych and connect Codex in Agents & Chat to choose a continuation model.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Open a Triptych and connect Codex in Agents & Chat to choose a continuation model."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "打开三联体，并在“智能体与聊天”中连接 Codex，以选择续写模型。"}}}}
